---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../../components/Sidebar.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="How to Install Cricfy TV on Android & Google TV (2026 Guide) - Gyan Browser"
  description="Are you looking to enjoy Cricfy TV on your Android device or Google TV in 2026? Follow this complete step-by-step sideloading guide."
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Article Content -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-2 bg-white dark:bg-darkcard border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4 leading-tight">
          How to Install Cricfy TV on Android & Google TV (2026 Guide)
        </h1>
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 pb-6 mb-6 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
          <span><i class="fa-regular fa-user"></i> Gyan Browser</span>
          <span><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> January 25, 2026</span>
          <span><i class="fa-solid fa-tag text-rose-600"></i> Android-TV</span>
        </div>

        <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Are you looking to enjoy Cricfy TV on your Android device or Google TV in 2026? Whether you want live sports, highlights, or your favorite cricket channels, this step-by-step guide will help you install Cricfy TV quickly and easily!
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-3 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">What You'll Learn in This Guide</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
            <li>Downloading and installing Cricfy TV on Android devices</li>
            <li>Installing Cricfy TV on Google TV (Sony, Mi, TCL, Fire Stick)</li>
            <li>Why a VPN may be needed for regional access</li>
            <li>Tips to make sure live streaming works smoothly without buffering</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-3 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Step 1: Download & Install APK</h2>
          <p>
            First, ensure your Android TV or mobile allows installation from unknown sources. Download the latest official APK version from a trusted source, and open it using a file manager or Downloader app on Google TV.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 my-4">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1 text-rose-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i> Pro Tip for Smart TV Users</h4>
            <p class="text-xs">Always use a stable Wi-Fi connection and keep your Android TV updated to the latest security patch for uninterrupted streaming.</p>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-3 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Final Thoughts</h2>
          <p>
            Installing Cricfy TV on Android and Google TV is now extremely straightforward. If you have any questions or faced any errors during installation, drop a comment below!
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <div>
        <Sidebar />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
